{"Using the full request.referer string as the targetOrigin breaks the postMessage call because window.parent only accepts origin strings of the form scheme://host[:port]; including the path/query from the referer means the target never matches, so the resize message is silently discarded and the iframe height never adjusts": 0.9599437713623047, "If a feed item doesn't expose a content element (common for RSS feeds that only provide description), i.content will be nil and the line raises NoMethodError: undefined method 'scrub' for nil:NilClass, aborting the whole polling job; should fall back to description or skip empty entries before calling scrub": 0.9400580525398254}